### 逐处错误标注
1. Nowdays → Nowadays（拼写错误）
2. develop fastly → fastly 为错误单词，fast 本身既是形容词也是副词
3. an increasing number of areas develop fastly have become → 一句两套谓语，语法杂糅，原句结构错误
4. My hometown among them → 缺少谓语动词，改为 My hometown is one of them
5. hometown have → hometown 是单数主语，谓语用 has
6. a extreme → extreme 元音开头，用 an
7. comparing before → 固定搭配 compared with the past
8. what change most → 现在完成时，what has changed most
9. where its clean streets → 从句无谓语，its 用词错误
10. tiny trees → tiny 微小的，语义不合适，改用 lush（茂盛的）
11. people's mind of environmental protection → mind 改为 awareness（意识）更贴合四级写作
12. have a great highlight → 搭配错误，语义不通，改为 has improved greatly
13. an elder → 书面写作优先 an elderly resident
14. helped by country → 逻辑主语错误，这里是公共设施得到政府扶持，改为 with support from the government；country 前加 the
15. public service → service 此处表服务设施，可数，改为 public services
16. casaully → casually（拼写错误）
17. What a wonderful attraction that people live happily → attraction 词义错误，句子结构混乱，attraction 是景点，不适合描述生活场景
18. keep our country and hometown on our heart → 固定搭配 keep ... in mind
19. build our motherland commonly → commonly 用词不当，改为 jointly（共同地）
20. people'lives → 所有格错误，改为 people’s lives


### 修正版
  Nowadays, with the progress of modernization, rapid development in an increasing number of areas has become a common phenomenon. My hometown is one of them.As far as I am 
concerned, my hometown has experienced extreme changes compared with the past.
  For one thing, what has changed most is the environment. It boasts clean streets, lush trees and beautiful flowers. Thanks to environmental education, people’s awareness of 
environmental protection has improved greatly. I once saw an elderly resident clean the street voluntarily. For another, with support from the government, plenty of public 
services have been built in my hometown. When night falls, many elders go to the park, where they dance, sing and chat casually. It is a lovely scene showing people live happily.
  From my perspective, we should keep our hometown in mind. Only in this way can we jointly build our motherland and improve people’s lives.


