1. religions → regions  单词混淆，religion 是宗教；region 表示地区
2. boast a obvious progress → have witnessed remarkable progress；a → an 元音前用 an；progress 不可数，不用 a
3. by the modernization → thanks to modernization  介词搭配错误
4. a unprespected → an unexpected  拼写错误 + 元音开头用 an
5. fundamental facilities → infrastructure  地道表达；got an outstanding updata → have achieved outstanding updates  update 拼写错误，时态调整
6. have placed that old things before → have replaced the old ones  表达完全错误
7. living atmosphere → living environment  atmosphere 多指氛围；环境用 environment
8. on the other hand → On the other hand  句首首字母大写
9. evevating → elevating  拼写错误
10. fastly → rapidly  fast 本身可作副词，fastly 几乎不使用
11. than past → than before  固定搭配
12. somebody can pick rubbishes up → some people pick up rubbish  rubbish 不可数；时态不用 can
